{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43602","headline":"游长安诸寺联句 翊善坊保寿寺 光天帧赞联句 · 段成式","name":"游长安诸寺联句 翊善坊保寿寺 光天帧赞联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"观音化身，厥形孔怪。\n胣脑淫厉，衆魔膜拜。\n指梦鸿纷，牓列区界。\n其事明张，何不可解。\n阎阿德川，大士先天。\n衆象参罗，福源田田。\n百亿花发，百千灯然。\n胶如[络绎]，浩汗连緜。\n焰摩界戚，洛迦苦霁。\n正念皈依，衆青如𥶙\n戾滓可汰，痴膜可蜕。\n稽首如空，睟容若睇。\n阐提墨师，覩而面之。\n寸念不生，未遇乎而。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43602.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43602","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}